    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Orubaho orwakhabili rwamachina",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI namusunjila Musa mbu Baatsa orubaho rubili rwamachina rwingana shia orwambeli; nasi ndalahandiika khurubaho orwo amakhuwa keene akabeele khurubaho orwambeli, orwa wayaaraache. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibushili okhushia obe niwikasiye; mana nibushiele, otikulushe mushikulu shiaSinai, undilolosilieyo khubutenje bweshikulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omundu yesi aleshe okhutikulukha ninawe halala, kata omundu yesi aralolekha mushikulu shiosi ta; kata ebiayo nende tsing'ombe nabio biraaya mundaalila weshikulu eshio tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Musa yabaatsa orubaho rubili rwamachina rwingana shia orwambeli; Musa nahuuna mumabwibwi natikulukha natsia mushikulu shiaSinai, shinga OMWAMI olwa yali namulachile, nali nende orubaho orwo rubili rwamachina mumakhono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI niyeeshela mwileesi, nasinjilaho ninaye halala, niyeerumbula eliira liOMWAMI. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI nabira imbeliwe, narumbula mbu OMWAMI, OMWAMI, Nyasaye weshisa eshinji nende obukoosia, ourali omwangu okhutiilwa oburima ta, ne nowobuheeli oburalilu nobwatoto obunji; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oubabeelanga tsimbabasi abandu ebikhumila nebikhumila, ouleshelanga obumayaanu nende obukhayi nende obwonooni; nebutswa ouranyala okhuchweya okhumurakhwo eshiina omundu ouli neshikha ta; oukalusinjia akobumayaanu bwabakuuka yabo khubaana, khandi khubeetsukhulu, okhuula khulwibulo lwakhataru nende olwakhane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa naye niyaanguyilisia, nabunamia omurwe hasi, namwinamila OMWAMI. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nasunga mbu Nimba ningoosibwa imbeliwo, e Omwami, ekhusaaya mbu ochendenje hakari mwifwe; shichila noluyia lwabandu abelikosi litinyu; okhuleshele obumayaanu bweefwe nobwonooni bweefwe, nokhubukula khube obulaamebwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Indakano yatiryisibwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI nasunga mbu Lola, endi okhukhola indakano; imbeli wabandubo ndalakhola akamakana, akarashiakholwa mushialo shiosi, kata mwihanga liosi ta; abandu bosi nabo aba oli hakari wabwe balalola emilimo chiOMWAMI, shichila elia ekhukholela nelikhuwa liamariisia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Linda bulayi likhuwa elia ekhulaka inyanga yino; lola, enzilusia imbeliwo abaAmori, nabaKanaani, nabaHiti, nabaPerizi, nabaHiwi, nende abaYebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wilinde, oleshe okhulia omuuma nende abamenyanga mushibala ewa otsia, lileshe okhukhubeela omubero hakariwo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nebutswa mulikulenje ebimalilo biabwe, nimusasaka tsisiilo tsiabwe, nimurema emiAsheral chiabwe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okhuba shioleenamilenje nyasaye undi ta; shichila OMWAMI owa eliiralie ni Imbalikha, niye Nyasaye weimbalikha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu oleshe okhulia omuuma nende abamenyanga mushibala eshio, nabo nibaba nibatsia mubuheyi obwokhulonda khubanyasaye babwe, nibamalila abanyasaye babwe emisango, oundi khubo nakhulanga, nawe nolia khumusangokwe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nobukula khubaana babwe abakhaana nobakhweesia abaanabo, abaana babwe abakhaana abo nibatsia mubuheyi obwokhulonda khubanyasaye babwe, nibachila abaanabo nibatsia mubuheyi obwokhulonda khubanyasaye babwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oreekholela abanyasaye abasalule ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhole lisabo liemikaate echibulamwo amamela; tsindaalo musaafu olaliitsanga emikaate echibulamwo amamela, shinga olwa ndakhulaka, khunduukho eyomumwesi kwaAbibu; shichila mumwesi kwaAbibu warula eMisiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebiibulwa biambeli biosi biemiruko nebianje; mbu emirukochio chiosi chieshisaatsa, ebiibulwa biambeli bietsing'ombe nebiamakondi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eshiibulwa shiambeli shieisishili oshinunulenje nende eshimeemene noba noreenya okhushinunula ta, oshifunache likosi. Abeekulanda bosi mubaanabo, obanunulenje. Omundu yesi aleshe okhulolekha imbeli wanje nali butswa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsindaalo tsisasaba okholenje emilimochio, ne khunyanga yomusaafu ohuluushenje; mwilima khandi mwichesa ohuluushenje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okholenje lisabo liamahonga, eliebirongole bielichesa lieingano; khandi nende lisabo liokhwinjisia, khubumaliilishi bwomuyika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khataru mumuyika abeshisaatsabo bosi baloleshenje imbeli w Nyasaye, Nyasaye waIsiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila ndaleelusinjia amahanga imbeliwo, nimbambula tsinzakhotsiokata omundu yesi shialiikomba eshialeshio ta, elwa oliba notikulukhanga notsia okhulolekha imbeli w Nyasayewo khataru mumuyika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orahaana amalasile akomusango kwanje halala nende omukaate okulimwo amamela ta; kata omusango kwelisabo lieipasaka kuleshe okhusikala kukone okhuula mukamba tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.25",
