          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abaana baIsiraeli nibalola mumoni mwaMusa, shinga likhoba eliomumonimwe olwa liang'inang'inanga; mana Musa yeefwimbanga olububi mumoni khandi, okhuula olwa yeenjila okhusungana ninaye.",
          "type": "text",
